From 5e356aa930bba9ccb6eb0f2908fe36c80489f55c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Leoyzen <leoyzen@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 22:11:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] [Quantization] Add 8 novel H200 [32,32] fp8_w8a8 tuned
 configs

Add tuned block-FP8 [32,32] tables for 8 H200 (SM90) shapes that had no
config on main, so the tuned kernel path can be selected for them:

  - N=512,K=5120
  - N=1280,K=5120
  - N=1536,K=5120
  - N=32768,K=1280
  - N=5120,K=8192
  - N=5120,K=15360
  - N=4608,K=5120
  - N=5120,K=2304

All 8 files are new; none of the existing H200 [32,32] tables are
modified. Tables come from a local tuning sweep on the H200 SM90 part.
